00:08:16.342 --> 00:08:17.175
Do you know what's funny though,

00:08:17.175 --> 00:08:19.560
is everybody describes you as
the nicest guy in Hollywood,

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.720
I think she is the nicest
woman in the industry.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:23.474
She's probably the kindest
thing you could run into.

00:08:23.474 --> 00:08:24.307
- [Henry] Oh my god.
- She's so nice.

00:08:24.307 --> 00:08:26.037
- And so filled with this...

00:08:26.037 --> 00:08:27.070
- [Kelly] And like, real.

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:28.440
- [Henry] Yeah. Yeah.
- Like authentic.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.270
And has real conversations with you that

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:31.257
aren't like vacant.
- [Henry] Oh my god.

00:08:31.257 --> 00:08:33.055
- And can do what she says she does.

00:08:33.055 --> 00:08:33.888
(audience applauds)
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:33.888 --> 00:08:34.721
- Whoop!

00:08:34.721 --> 00:08:35.970
- [Kelly] Absolutely. I know.

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:37.383
Okay, next one, here we go.

00:08:40.457 --> 00:08:42.983
♪ Who will it be? ♪

00:08:42.983 --> 00:08:44.901
Oh well, Bill Hader.

00:08:44.901 --> 00:08:45.734
- Bill Hader, I know.

00:08:45.734 --> 00:08:46.567
- Yeah?

00:08:46.567 --> 00:08:48.480
- Bill Hader gave me a life.

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:52.711
I was 7, 27 when I got the Fonz.

00:08:52.711 --> 00:08:53.544
(audience member whoops)

00:08:53.544 --> 00:08:55.558
And then I auditioned for Barry,

00:08:55.558 --> 00:08:58.560
and, which is going on,
in just a little while.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:08:59.490
- Yeah.
(audience cheers)

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:00.813
- For the fourth season.

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:02.670
- [Kelly] So exciting.

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:06.480
- And I, and Bill Hader and Alec Berg

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:11.480
said yes to me when I was
72, to play Gene Cousineau.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:13.560
- I, well of course they would swat-

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:16.500
- Well, I, not, not, not necessarily.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:17.940
- So for those who haven't caught up,

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:18.810
what's happening on Barry?

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:19.643
- Okay.

00:09:19.643 --> 00:09:21.330
I can't tell you because they'll kill me.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.970
- Okay. Well nice to have y'all today!

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:24.720
- But, oh so, here I am,

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:27.510
I'm driving across the country.

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:30.510
Gene is, you know, I, I
turned him in last season.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:31.343
- [Kelly] Yep.

00:09:31.343 --> 00:09:33.510
- Hoohoo. Because he killed my girlfriend.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:34.620
- That's a solid move.

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:35.490
Yeah, he turns, yeah.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:36.323
- [Henry] Oh you got to, right?

00:09:36.323 --> 00:09:38.520
- [Kelly] Yeah. Yeah.
- Oh, I loved her, Janice.

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.350
So I'm driving across the country!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.090
I'm going through Kansas!

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:44.100
There is corn all around me!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:48.243
All of a sudden a cop car
comes from the other direction!

00:09:50.392 --> 00:09:51.225
- [Audience] That's it?

00:09:51.225 --> 00:09:52.380
(audience laughs)

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:54.330
- Are you? That's a great tease.

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.788
I'm like, "And?"
- Not only is it a tease,

00:09:55.788 --> 00:09:56.874
I just made it up.

00:09:56.874 --> 00:09:59.207
(all laugh)

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:02.550
- [Kelly] Oh my god!

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:06.030
I was like, "And what happens?"

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:08.880
While we do have a clip,
that was incredible.

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:09.713
- [Henry] Thank you.

00:10:09.713 --> 00:10:11.733
Here's Henry Winkler
in "Barry", everybody.

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:15.303
- His arm around my grandson,

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.303
death in his eyes.

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:21.513
And then I realize,

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:25.140
he's not in charge.

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:25.973
I am.

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:28.890
I know how to press those buttons.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.573
Hey, I installed them.

00:10:34.567 --> 00:10:36.177
"I love you, Barry."

00:10:37.357 --> 00:10:38.797
"You do?"

00:10:38.797 --> 00:10:40.477
"You betcha."

00:10:40.477 --> 00:10:42.607
"Can you say it again?"

00:10:42.607 --> 00:10:44.820
"Sure, why not?

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:46.477
I love you."

00:10:46.477 --> 00:10:49.938
"Mr. Cousineau, I would do
anything for your forgiveness."

00:10:49.938 --> 00:10:50.963
(audience cheers)

00:10:50.963 --> 00:10:53.250
- Season four of "Barry" is on HBO,

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.750
y'all be sure to check it out!

